meta {
  name: Get History QR Code
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/lend/qr/history
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get History QR Code

  This request is used to get history of qr code. This request interacts with the MySQL database, has a pagination, and has protected routes.

  ## Responses

  **200 — lend qr code fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "lend qr code fetched",
    "data": {
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "d8b5d4cc-805d-3303-3966-dc767c062d27",
          "lend_qr_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/gudangku-94edc.appspot.com/o/lend%2F...",
          "qr_period": 2,
          "created_at": "2024-03-19 02:37:58",
          "lend_desc": "lorem ipsum",
          "lend_status": "expired",
          "is_finished": 0,
          "list_inventory": "Herborist Aloe Vera Gel (Skin & Body Care), Palmolive Shower Gel Absoule Relax (Food And Beverages)"
        }
      ],
      "current_page": 1,
      "last_page": 5,
      "per_page": 10,
      "total": 50
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — lend qr code failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "lend qr code not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}